       "children": [],
       "classes": [],
       "customAttributes": {},
       "element": "p",
       "innerHTML": "Encore started in 2024 after our founders closed their 200th combined board pack at 2am. The grudge was against the spreadsheet; the affection, weirdly, too. So we kept the grid, the keys and the formulas, and rebuilt everything underneath them.",
